OL,3,GNEWSAHospital declares critical
OL,4,Aincident amid high demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has declared a critical
OL,7,Fincident due to "severe and sustained
OL,8,Fpressure" on its services.
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals Coventry and
OL,11,FWarwickshire (UHCW) said there was an
OL,12,Fexceptionally high demand for emergency
OL,13,Fcare, alongside significant pressure on
OL,14,Fhospital beds.
OL,16,FTracey Brigstock, chief nursing
OL,17,Fofficer, asked the public to only
OL,18,Fattend the Coventry hospital's
OL,19,Femergency department if they had a
OL,20,Flife-threatening situation.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
