OL,3,GNEWSAHospital declares critical
OL,4,Aincident amid high demand
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I am sorry for the disruption this may
OL,7,Fcause and thank our staff for their
OL,8,Fcontinued professionalism," Brigstock
OL,9,Fadded.
